<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt;text-align:left">approval for listing the shares of Parent common stock issuable to the Company&#8217;s shareholders as Merger Consideration on the New York Stock Exchange (the &#8220;<span style="text-decoration:underline">NYSE</span>&#8221;); </p></td></tr></table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
